    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rollo Boi</strong> is a thrilling controller-based physics puzzle platformer where you take on the role of an adventurous rolling ball. Your mission? Collect coins, unlock powerful abilities, and conquer vibrant worlds filled with challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller-Powered Gameplay</strong>: Use the left and right triggers on your Xbox or PlayStation controller to make the ball roll! (Controller recommended but not required.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Diverse Worlds</strong>: Embark on an epic journey through 6 unique worlds, each containing 5 challenging levels. That's 30 levels of pure platforming fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Unique Abilities</strong>: Roll, Super Jump, and Reverse Gravity to navigate through obstacles and reach new heights. Unlock a new power-up at the end of each world to aid you in your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzle Mechanics</strong>: Solve intricate puzzles and use physics to your advantage to progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eye-Popping Neon Aesthetics</strong>: Immerse yourself in a stunning neon-colored world that brings the game to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to roll through this mesmerizing adventure and prove your skills? Dive into <strong>Rollo Boi</strong> now and experience the excitement firsthand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rollo Boi</strong> is a thrilling controller-based physics puzzle platformer where you take on the role of an adventurous rolling ball. Your mission? Collect coins, unlock powerful abilities, and conquer vibrant worlds filled with challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller-Powered Gameplay</strong>: Use the left and right triggers on your Xbox or PlayStation controller to make the ball roll! (Controller recommended but not required.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Diverse Worlds</strong>: Embark on an epic journey through 6 unique worlds, each containing 5 challenging levels. That's 30 levels of pure platforming fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Unique Abilities</strong>: Roll, Super Jump, and Reverse Gravity to navigate through obstacles and reach new heights. Unlock a new power-up at the end of each world to aid you in your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzle Mechanics</strong>: Solve intricate puzzles and use physics to your advantage to progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eye-Popping Neon Aesthetics</strong>: Immerse yourself in a stunning neon-colored world that brings the game to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to roll through this mesmerizing adventure and prove your skills? Dive into <strong>Rollo Boi</strong> now and experience the excitement firsthand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
